meno-paradox.logic.r3: argue/two-senses: P3 (S2): "knows" is taken as has at least enough acquaintance to know what the subject is in P3 and as knows fully what the answer about it is where knows is used else, a reader says
meno-paradox.logic.r3: argue/two-senses: P2 (S2): "enquire" is taken as has a reason or need to enquire about it in P2 and as is able to enquire about it where can_enquire is used else, a reader says
